<title>FRANCE: Officials confirm EU oat export award at 98,500 T.</title>
<headline>Officials confirm EU oat export award at 98,500 T.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday awarded export refunds of a maximum 30.25 Ecus per tonne for 98,500 tonnes of Scandinavian oats, member country officials said, confirming trade reports.</p>
<p>Earlier traders had said the amount of oats was either 98,500, 96,500 or between 90,000 and 95,000 tonnes at 30.25 Ecus. --Paris newsroom +331 4221 5146</p>
</text>
